---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Pigeon from "../../assets/bpPigeon.png";
---

<Layout>
    <h1><strong><em>PIGEON!</em></strong></h1>
    <br />
    <br />
    <p>
        If you haven't noticed already, I kinda like pigeons. This is a page
        about pigeons. While you are learing about the best bird, try and find
        all 20 hidden pigeons, you'll get a very secret achievement if you do!
        <br />
        <br />
        Look, theres one right there!
    </p>
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="1" />
    <img
        src={Pigeon.src}
        class="pigeon"
        data-id="2"
        style="top: 45px; left: 0px;"
    />
    <img
        src={Pigeon.src}
        class="pigeon"
        data-id="3"
        style="top:450px; left: 50%; width:10px"
    />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="4" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="5" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="6" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="7" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="8" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="9" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="10" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="11" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="12" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="13" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="14" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="15" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="16" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="17" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="18" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="19" style="position: ;" />
    <img src={Pigeon.src} class="pigeon" data-id="20" style="position: ;" />
    <br /><br /><br />
    <p>
        Oh and I know very little actual information about pigeons and I'm way
        too egotistical to google anything. Enjoy!<br /><br />
        So pigeons are actually one of the best animals. This is because they are
        actually quite intelligent have very few tasks in life. Pigeons are just cute
        little bystanders to life. They have very few motives for murder and enjoy
        driving buses.<br /><br />
        Pigeons probably live to around 15 years old based on the vibes they give
        off. Due to the almost domestication of the species has lead them to live
        shorter but happier lives. Most die to natural causes from the city air they
        breathe in and the significant lack of major predators. Pigeons also commonly
        die from an issue commonly called 'string foot' which occurs when a poor little
        pigeon gets their feet stuck in string, hair or some other material on the
        ground. This then tangles around their foot and can stop walking, cause deformities
        and restrict blood flow depending on severity.
    </p>
    <div id="counter">Pigeons found: 0 / 20!</div>
</Layout>
<script>
    const found = new Set(
        JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem("foundPigeons") || "[]"),
    );

    const counter = document.getElementById("counter");

    function updateCounter() {
        counter.textContent = `Pigeons found: ${found.size} /20!`;

        if (found.size === 1) {
            window.unlockAchievement?.("ONE_PIGEON");
        }

        if (found.size === 10) {
            window.unlockAchievement?.("TEN_PIGEONS");
        }

        if (found.size === 20) {
            window.unlockAchievement?.("ALL_PIGEONS");
        }
    }

    document.querySelectorAll(".pigeon").forEach((pigeon) => {
        const id = pigeon.dataset.id;

        if (found.has(id)) {
            pigeon.classList.add("found");
        }

        pigeon.addEventListener("click", () => {
            if (found.has(id)) return;

            found.add(id);
            pigeon.classList.add("found");

            localStorage.setItem("foundPigeons", JSON.stringify([...found]));

            updateCounter();
        });
    });

    updateCounter();
</script>
